{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1053.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"9baeb2788344645eaeec9c00377c354107e0d22b6df47c96b44ecf7c8baebbf4","ja":"環とまつりのプライベート動画","zh":"环和茉莉的私人视频","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1053.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"80c85f11e69aebaff4e81f26b42afd3eedec786b6590788c2de4f90cc3534eb8","ja":"あら？　ふたりで何か打ち合わせ中かしら？","zh":"哎呀？你们两个人是在商量什么吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1053.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"b90376b7f94ebd8a638e752329e3229b0bf14ae1db313c77b14d165178c65e4e","ja":"うん！　まつりとバラエティ番組に出るんだ！\nたまきたちのプライベート動画を撮るんだって！","zh":"嗯！我和茉莉要上综艺节目呢！\n说是要拍环她们平时的私下视频哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1053.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"0a795638866b69e5733c74b0a8badd4437afc8a43dff7ba9a0d531d886e528a3","ja":"アイドルの休日を密着取材！\nとってもワクワクな企画なのですよ♪","zh":"跟拍偶像假日的独家采访！\n是非常让人兴奋的企划哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1053.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"639f7feeb335773fdbca3ef318852cbaf98782042f567b4737de61900bcdc2bc","ja":"よかったらあずさちゃんも、どんな動画にしたら\nいいのか、意見を聞かせてほしいのです。","zh":"要是可以的话，也希望能听听梓关于\n拍什么样的视频比较好的意见。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1053.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"3023bd3cd4fa7838fdcf035a5257a7188058ef81eca281296919171f211c733a","ja":"ええ、ぜひ♪\nええと……撮影場所も、自由に決められるのかしら？","zh":"好啊，我很乐意♪\n那个……拍摄地点也是可以自由决定的吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1053.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"53a85f8293654b833e19a94ca50819088351751f52c1a9b173111785d80bb9ff","ja":"うん！\nたまき、動物園に行きたいな！","zh":"嗯！\n环想去动物园！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1053.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"225b49f577669001d4c473d8ba11ee858637a7aae6cec604669c5422bd588c73","ja":"番組を見てる人に、\n面白い動物のこと、いっぱい紹介するんだ！","zh":"要把好多好多有趣的动物，\n介绍给看节目的人！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1053.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"f9281104d44dc5aedc36e94cffce9c5b80c380519c04128e33a05eabf928aeb8","ja":"ふふっ、素敵ね♪\n環ちゃん、動物園にはよく行くの？","zh":"呵呵，真棒呢♪\n环，你经常去动物园吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1053.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"163e3a4d1460ef88d8532d54098996bc3126d68f0353dcbed1c2f8265ddc7fba","ja":"ううん、ちがうよ。もしかして、\nいつも行ってる場所のほうがいい？","zh":"不是的，才没有呢。难道说，\n去平时常去的地方比较好吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1053.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"f97174bc711a62e1d4f1a84bba015d9d35e8f62c43b9e66a15052d0f5882a86b","ja":"確かに、姫たちの普段の生活を知りたいっていう\nファンの人もいそうなのです。","zh":"确实，感觉也会有粉丝\n想了解公主们平时的日常生活呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1053.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"5844cf37a281c85ceec26494e9f4b76131b77bb75b165ae78c42f44e447c5fe0","ja":"そうね……番組を見る人が一番興味を持っている\nことは何かって考えるのも、いいかもしれないわね。","zh":"也是呢……思考一下看节目的人最感兴趣的\n事情是什么，或许也不错呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1053.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"bc7c58469d9c4be5ca34b2640ae04c37703644acdd1f621b61b1dd8f0d43a82d","ja":"そっか……。たまきだったら、\nどんなことを知りたいかな……あっ！　","zh":"这样啊……要是环的话，\n会想知道些什么呢……啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1053.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"3035df8d8e8d9cb7b9c81031c9cffd38bdd35ca21c6794430e8d6f4e1ac2ac1d","ja":"たまき、まつりのお休みのこと知りたいぞ！\nねえねえ、お姫さまのお休みってどんなことするの？","zh":"环想知道茉莉休假时都做什么！\n呐呐，公主殿下休息的时候都会做些什么呀？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1053.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"c25c832779cb1e5d37edd60e33c3c8a24bf9c583359128471c4ee9dc42b72cb6","ja":"姫は……馬車に乗って森に行ったり、\nプライベートガーデンでお茶をしたりするのですよ♪","zh":"公主可是会……坐着马车去森林，\n或者在私家花园里喝茶的哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1053.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"40bee7a13295f58fa602442a1fd19f9e823324ae9b2ba294d751506724c8d48e","ja":"わあっ……馬車に乗るの！？\nすごいな～、うらやましいぞ！","zh":"哇啊……要坐马车吗！？\n好厉害啊～真羡慕你呀！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1053.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"25044609906e5d61b30594a90326292c9a35159d6b1e7605c8847bca1400d293","ja":"ありがとうなのです。\nですが今回はぜひ、環ちゃんのお休みを……。","zh":"非常感谢。\n不过这次请务必给环放个假……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1053.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"dd27721311c6e389ea84d1a16fa52f174679b81ac36e5458579ef2724f89b49f","ja":"たまき、お姫さまなお休みやってみたい！\nまつりのお休みを撮影してもらおー！","zh":"环想试试看公主一样的假期！\n去拍一拍茉莉的假期吧～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1053.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"58093d05adc72d0e5628daa00b2b42b0c26cc6a577de170250cd43622a03e0c8","ja":"そ、それは……！","zh":"那、那是……！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1053.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"1c8da4c79012f242f14283fd9026edbc02ae99123bd4b6bd026875666dfecdc7","ja":"……わかったのです。\nまつりにお任せ！なのですよ！","zh":"……茉莉明白了。\n就交给茉莉吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
